        ],
        "en": [
          "Born in 1941 in the heart of the Oise orchards, Pomélys is the living legacy of a family farm handed down from father to son.\nFrom Guy to Arnaud and Sébastien, each generation has cultivated the land with passion and respect.\nToday, this history has given birth to organic juices, ciders and bubbles, pressed on the farm and all with an authentic taste."
        ],
